{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabime/spdlog/issues/266","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabime/spdlog","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabime/spdlog/issues/266/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabime/spdlog/issues/266/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabime/spdlog/issues/266/events","html_url":"https://github.com/gabime/spdlog/issues/266","id":173133507,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxNzMxMzM1MDc=","number":266,"title":"Improperly-formatted ISO8601 UTC offset for negative-offset timezones","user":{"login":"woobs","id":8964431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5NjQ0MzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8964431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/woobs","html_url":"https://github.com/woobs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woobs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woobs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woobs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woobs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woobs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woobs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woobs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woobs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/woobs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":143591002,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNDM1OTEwMDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabime/spdlog/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"fc2929","default":true,"description":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2016-08-25T07:38:06Z","updated_at":"2016-08-25T21:46:57Z","closed_at":"2016-08-25T21:46:57Z","author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"The `z_formatter` formats negative-offset timezones incorrectly.  For example, it should format CDT as \"-05:00\", but instead formats it as \"-5:00\" because the padding function formats the integer value `-5` as \"-5\" and `+5` as \"05\".  This doesn't conform to ISO8601 and could create problems for log parsers that expect fixed-width times.  Thus, I would consider this a minor bug.\n\nSeems the fix should be somewhere near [pattern_formatter_impl.h@325](https://github.com/gabime/spdlog/blob/master/include/spdlog/details/pattern_formatter_impl.h#L325).  Perhaps by adding a \"-\" to the formatted output for negative hour offsets and then sending the absolute value of the hour offset to the padding function.\n","closed_by":{"login":"gabime","id":6052198,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTIxOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6052198?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabime","html_url":"https://github.com/gabime","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabime/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabime/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabime/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabime/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabime/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabime/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabime/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabime/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gabime/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabime/spdlog/issues/266/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gabime/spdlog/issues/266/timeline","perform